---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';

// 10DLC / TCR review note:
// The "Text Messaging Terms" section below is mandatory for A2P 10DLC registration.
// Reviewers look for these three things, close to verbatim:
//   • "Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages."
//   • STOP / HELP instructions
//   • "Message and data rates may apply."
// Do not reword, summarize, or split those sentences.

const effective = 'August 12, 2026';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Rob Recio · Mississippi Gulf Coast Real Estate"
  description="Terms of Service for robrecio.com, including text messaging terms, STOP and HELP instructions, and message and data rate disclosures."
  robots="index, follow"
>

  <main class="legal">
    <header class="legal-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="legal-meta">Effective {effective} · Robert Recio (Rob Recio) · Ocean Springs, Mississippi</p>
    </header>

    <div class="legal-body">

      <p>
        These Terms of Service govern your use of <strong>www.robrecio.com</strong> (the "Site"),
        operated by Robert Recio, a licensed Mississippi real estate salesperson (License
        #S-62221) affiliated with Real Broker, LLC. By using the Site or submitting a form on it,
        you agree to these terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Use of the Site</h2>
      <p>
        The Site is provided for general information about Mississippi Gulf Coast real estate and
        to let you get in touch with me. You agree to use it lawfully and not to interfere with
        its operation, scrape it, or submit false information through its forms.
      </p>

      <h2 id="sms">Text Messaging Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By providing your mobile number and checking the text-message consent box on a form on
        this Site, you agree to receive text messages from Robert Recio regarding real estate
        services, property inquiries, scheduling, and related communications.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Consent is not a condition of purchase.</strong> You are not required to agree to receive text messages in order to submit a form, receive information, or work with me.</li>
        <li><strong>Message frequency varies</strong> depending on your inquiry and our ongoing conversation.</li>
        <li><strong>Message and data rates may apply.</strong> Charges are set by your mobile carrier, not by me.</li>
        <li><strong>To opt out, reply STOP</strong> to any message. You will receive a single confirmation and no further messages.</li>
        <li><strong>For assistance, reply HELP</strong> to any message, or contact me at (228) 325-1502 or rob@robrecio.com.</li>
        <li><strong>Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</strong></li>
        <li>Supported carriers may change without notice. Text messaging is available on most major U.S. wireless carriers.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Text messaging originator opt-in data and consent will not be shared with any third
        parties. See the <a href="/privacy#sms">Privacy Policy</a> for how this information is
        handled.
      </p>

      <h2>No agency relationship until agreed in writing</h2>
      <p>
        Contacting me through the Site, or receiving information from me, does not by itself
        create a brokerage or agency relationship. A representation agreement is established only
        in a signed written agreement, as required by Mississippi law and Real Broker, LLC.
      </p>

      <h2>Property information</h2>
      <p>
        Listing details, market figures, guides, and area information on the Site are gathered
        from sources believed reliable but are not guaranteed accurate and are subject to change
        or withdrawal without notice. Nothing on the Site is an offer to buy or sell real
        property. Verify all information independently before relying on it.
      </p>

      <h2>Not legal, tax, insurance, or financial advice</h2>
      <p>
        Content on the Site — including guides covering flood zones, insurance, homestead
        exemption, and disclosures — is general information, not professional advice. Consult a
        qualified attorney, tax professional, insurance agent, or lender about your situation.
      </p>

      <h2>Fair housing</h2>
      <p>
        I am committed to the letter and the spirit of U.S. policy for the achievement of equal
        housing opportunity throughout the nation. All real estate advertised on this Site is
        subject to the federal Fair Housing Act and Mississippi law, which make it illegal to
        indicate any preference, limitation, or discrimination based on race, color, religion,
        sex, handicap, familial status, or national origin.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party links</h2>
      <p>
        The Site links to other websites I do not control. Those links are provided for
        convenience, and I am not responsible for their content, accuracy, or privacy practices.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        The Site is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. To the fullest extent
        permitted by law, Robert Recio is not liable for any indirect, incidental, or
        consequential damages arising from your use of the Site or reliance on its content.
      </p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>
        These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Mississippi, without regard to its
        conflict of law rules.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
      <p>
        These terms may be updated from time to time. The revised version will be posted here
        with a new effective date, and continued use of the Site means you accept it.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Robert Recio (Rob Recio)<br />
        Licensed Mississippi Real Estate Salesperson #S-62221 · Real Broker, LLC<br />
        Ocean Springs, Mississippi<br />
        Phone / text: <a href="tel:+12283251502">(228) 325-1502</a><br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:rob@robrecio.com">rob@robrecio.com</a>
      </p>

      <p class="legal-crosslink">
        See also: <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
      </p>

    </div>
  </main>

</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .legal {
    max-width: var(--max-prose);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem 1rem;
  }
  .legal-hero { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }
  .legal h1 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.7rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .legal-meta {
    font-size: 0.87rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-top: 0.7rem;
  }
  .legal-body { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .legal-body h2 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 2.2rem 0 0.8rem;
  }
  .legal-body p { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .legal-body ul {
    margin: 0 0 1.2rem 1.1rem;
    padding-left: 0.4rem;
  }
  .legal-body li { margin-bottom: 0.55rem; }
  .legal-body strong { color: var(--ink); }
  .legal-crosslink {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
</style>
